<!-- acc_customer_servic_plan -->
<section class="master_wrap acc_customer_servic_plan">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <p><strong>Providing Goods and Services to People with Disabilities</strong></p>
        <p>
            <strong>The Cardy Group </strong>is committed to excellence in serving all customers including people with
            disabilities.
        </p>
        <p>We will ensure that our staff are trained and familiar with various assistive devices.</p>
        <p><strong>Communication</strong></p>
        <p>We will communicate with people with disabilities in ways that take into account their disability.</p>
        <p><strong>Service animals</strong></p>
        <p>
            We welcome people with disabilities and their service animals. Service animals are allowed on the parts of our
            premises that are open to the public.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Support persons</strong></p>
        <p>
            A person with a disability who is accompanied by a support person will be allowed to have that person accompany
            them on our premises.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Training</strong></p>
        <p>
            <strong>The Cardy Group</strong> will provide training to employees, who deal with the public or other third
            parties on our behalf. This training will be provided to new staff upon the time of hiring.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Notice of temporary disruption</strong></p>
        <p>
            In the event of a planned or unexpected disruption to services or facilities for clients/vendors with
            disabilities, The Cardy Group will notify clients/vendors promptly. This posted notice will include information
            about the reason for the disruption, its anticipated length of time, and a
            description of alternative facilities or services, if available.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Feedback process</strong></p>
        <p>
            Any person wishing to provide feedback on the way <strong>The Cardy Group</strong> provides goods and services
            to people with disabilities can provide feedback by emailing TCG at info@thecardygroup.com.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
<!-- acc_customer_servic_plan -->